WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.124
Step 1. Open the appointment.

1.2
00:00:02.124 --> 00:00:06.713
Checking in changes the appointment's status from Booked to Checked-In.

1.3
00:00:06.713 --> 00:00:09.879
Open the appointment from the Appointments board,

1.4
00:00:09.879 --> 00:00:12.641
and Care shows Appointment Details.

2.1
00:00:12.641 --> 00:00:14.952
Step 2. Check in the patient.

2.2
00:00:14.952 --> 00:00:20.852
In the patient card at the top of Appointment Details, select Check-In, or press C.

2.3
00:00:20.852 --> 00:00:24.834
Care sets the appointment's status to Checked-In.
